B.bA2=new A.tN("LaTeX packages","Package commands, symbols and drawings in lib/src/macros/ and lib/src/symbols/.","val_latex transcribes command definitions, symbol tables, colour values\nand glyph drawings from these LaTeX packages and files, as distributed\nwith TeX Live: accents, amsmath, amssymb, amsthm, amsxtra, bbm, bm,\ncases, centernot, commath, derivative, diffcoeff, empheq, esint, esvect,\nextarrows, extpfeil, fontmath.ltx and tuenc.def (the LaTeX kernel),\ngraphics (its dvips colour definitions), harpoon, interval, mathabx,\nmathtools, mhchem, mismath, mleftright, nccmath, nicefrac, physics,\nsiunitx, slashed, stmaryrd, tensor, unicode-math, units, upgreek,\nwasysym, xcolor, xfrac and yhmath.\n\nEach of them is the work of its authors and keeps its own licence, the\nLaTeX Project Public License for most. val_latex's code is a modified,\nindependent version written in Dart: it is not, and does not replace,\nany of those files.")
